  "question": {
    "text": "A ball is projected with kinetic energy <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>E</mi></math>, at an angle of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>60</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></math> to the horizontal. The kinetic energy of this ball at the highest point of its flight will become :"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "Zero",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>E</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mi>E</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>E</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "C"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p><img src=\"assets\\st0049_93c961b614c5.png\" style=\"width: 250px; height: 83px;\" /></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>E</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>m</mi><msup><mi>u</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p>At the Highest point, velocity is equal to the horizontal component of the velocity of projection. Therefore,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>u</mi><mi>cos</mi><mn>60</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>u</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo></math> Kinetic energy&nbsp;at the&nbsp;topmost point <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>m</mi><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mi>u</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>E</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math></p></blockquote>"
  }
